\", \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.17086\", \"country\": \"NGA\", \"note\": \"Not employment-weighted and not a share of jobs: the denominator is a common task universe, so variation across countries reflects country-conditioned labelling, not the size of each country's exposed workforce.\", \"relation\": \"=\", \"metric_id\": \"jobs-tasks\", \"pillar\": \"Jobs\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"limit\": \"Modelled task share; not job losses.\"}, {\"id\": \"052b57c6ca8a6c\", \"label\": \"Employment-weighted exposure\", \"value\": null, \"period\": \"2026 study\", \"status\": \"modelled\", \"source\": \"Observatory coverage\", \"source_url\": \"https://inferenceafrica.com/data/jobs-exposure.csv\", \"country\": \"NGA\", \"note\": \"No information in this register.\", \"relation\": \"=\", \"metric_id\": \"jobs-weighted\", \"pillar\": \"Jobs\", \"unit\": \"index\", \"limit\": \"Modelled index from 0 to 1; not a percentage.\"}, {\"id\": \"052b57c6ca8a6c\", \"label\": \"Mobile data · 5 GB minimum\", \"value\": 0.99, \"period\": \"2025\", \"status\": \"measured / official\", \"source\": \"ITU ICT Price Baskets, December 2025 release\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.itu.int/en/ITU-D/Statistics/Documents/ICT_Prices/ITU_ICTPriceBaskets_2008-2025.xlsx\", \"country\": \"NGA\", \"note\": \"ITU 2025 retail basket, selected under its representative-operator rules. At least 5 GB; actual allowance may be higher. Historical observation, not a current quote. The 5 GB mobile basket must not be spliced into the older 2 GB series. Connection charges and device costs are not added to this monthly figure. Evidence: official. Reviewed 2026-10-01. Retail basket prices collected under ITU rules; country prices are published in USD and as a share of monthly GNI per capita. Basket definitions changed in 2025.\", \"relation\": \"=\", \"metric_id\": \"cost-mobile-usd-2025\", \"pillar\": \"Access\", \"unit\": \"USD / month\", \"limit\": \"Historical retail basket; excludes device costs.\"}, {\"id\": \"052b57c6ca8a6c\", \"label\": \"Estimated generative AI use\", \"value\": 9.3, \"period\": \"H2 2025\", \"status\": \"modelled / vendor_estimate\", \"source\": \"Microsoft AI Economy Institute, Global AI Adoption in 2025\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Microsoft-AI-Diffusion-Report-January-2026.pdf\", \"country\": \"NGA\", \"note\": \"Generative-AI diffusion estimate adjusted from Microsoft telemetry for device/OS market share, internet penetration and population. Working-age denominator; not a direct population survey or a measure of workplace adoption. Appendix pp. 15–17. Evidence: vendor_estimate. Reviewed 2026-10-01. Generative-AI diffusion estimate adjusted from Microsoft telemetry for device/OS market share, internet penetration and population. Working-age denominator; not a direct population survey or a measure of workplace adoption. Appendix pp. 15–17.\", \"relation\": \"=\", \"metric_id\": \"adoption-estimate-h2-2025\", \"pillar\": \"Access\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"limit\": \"Modelled share of working-age population.\"}, {\"id\": \"052b57c6ca8a6c\", \"label\": \"Data centres listed\", \"value\": 42.0, \"period\": \"2026-10-05\", \"status\": \"derived; source-reported directory\", \"source\": \"Data Landscapers / InferenceAfrica\", \"source_url\": \"https://corpus.data-landscapers.io/datasets/data-centres/\", \"country\": \"NGA\", \"note\": \"Source-reported directory listings, not a national census. Includes commercial, government, enterprise and research facilities. Source claims have not been independently verified by InferenceAfrica. Campuses may contain multiple facilities. Do not add these counts or capacities to the project register. Formula: distinct facility IDs across all statuses. Input IDs: NGA-001, NGA-002, NGA-003, NGA-004, NGA-005, NGA-006, NGA-007, NGA-008, NGA-009, NGA-010, NGA-011, NGA-012, NGA-013, NGA-014, NGA-015, NGA-016, NGA-017, NGA-018, NGA-019, NGA-020, NGA-021, NGA-022, NGA